Z||000018||87ECO5||12-09-2000||08:12 AM||||<B>Cheever2</B> - the photo was taken at the Mid-Ohio track in Lexington, Ohio back in June.  The day was overcast and cold (which made the photo print badly in the calendar - sorry) but it was awesome nevertheless.  We got to take a few laps around the track with various other makes and models (ChadMan - wasn't BMW the showcased make this year?).<P>Among the cars in the row are <B>ChadMan</B>, <B>2M4 Dale</B>, <B>yellow3800sc</B> and that little tiny white coupe on the far left is me!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Maybe I should have put that in the calendar - again sorry.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P><B>DrRodey</B> - we have more if you want more.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
